3,Musique traditionnelle Téké - YouTube Music,https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLMlzF7vaMKus6aPD71pH0xqO86QeN6F2F,"Listen to Musique traditionnelle Téké on YouTube Music - a dedicated music app with official songs, music videos, remixes, covers, and more.",Teke-Eboo,Niger-Congo
4,"Teke-Eboo Language (EBO) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/show_language.asp?code=ebo,"Teke-Eboo is an endangered indigenous language of Congo and the Democratic Republic of the Congo. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. The language is used as a first language by all adults in the ethnic community, but not all young people. It is not known to be taught in schools.",Teke-Eboo,Niger-Congo
5,Teke-Eboo language - globalrecordings.net,https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/ebo,"Audio recordings available in Teke-Eboo These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who are not literate or are from oral cultures, particularly unreached people groups.",Teke-Eboo,Niger-Congo
6,"Kiteke: Nord language. Evangelism tools, church planting ...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/1554,"Short audio Bible stories and evangelistic messages that explain salvation and give basic Christian teaching. Each program is a customised and culturally relevant selection of scripts, and may include songs and music.",Teke-Eboo,Niger-Congo
